# --- Files that cite by internal evidence-record id (existence-only) ---
# In these, a study is named by its register id (EV-041) and the author/title
# live in src/biology_as_code/engine/data/evidence_candidates_LAW026.json, which
# check_pmids now reads directly and checks STRICTLY. Duplicating the title into
# the prose to satisfy a gate would be writing for the gate, not the reader.
docs/VALIDATION.md  cites studies by evidence-record id; the authoritative pmid+title pair is in the LAW026 evidence register, checked strictly there.
docs/VALIDATION_LEDGER.md  same: cites by evidence-record id, register carries the checked pair.
CHANGELOG.md  release notes referring to studies by evidence-record id; register carries the checked pair.
docs/related-projects.md  cites a paper's id to say it is NOT in PMC and could not be read; the point is the access barrier, not the content.
